(4945891, 719364, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s incredibly done.  Looks like something in a nature magazine.  Fantastic.</td>', 'That''s incredibly done.  Looks like something in a nature magazine.  Fantastic.', '2008-09-10 01:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4945893, 718648, 19982, '<td valign="top">Bonus points for having both a foreground and background out of focus.  The thing I would ask myself is ... why that particular spot to be in focus?  Does it mean anything to you or the viewer?  Could picking a different focal point create a more compelling image?</td>', 'Bonus points for having both a foreground and background out of focus.  The thing I would ask myself is ... why that particular spot to be in focus?  Does it mean anything to you or the viewer?  Could picking a different focal point create a more compelling image?', '2008-09-10 01:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
