(4945900, 719352, 39349, '<td valign="top">No vote: comment only.<br/> <br/>Hey, I think I know that guy! :D <br/> <br/>Very nice shot Bjorn, I really like the composition and post processing. I hope it does well for you in the challenge. I can''t wait to shoot with you again, next time hopefully in Munich!<br/> <br/>Best regards,<br/>Steve</td>', 'No vote: comment only. Hey, I think I know that guy! :D  Very nice shot Bjorn, I really like the composition and post processing. I hope it does well for you in the challenge. I can''t wait to shoot with you again, next time hopefully in Munich! Best regards,Steve', '2008-09-10 01:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
