(4947949, 719511, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, light, and focus. I really like the way the colors of the bee''s face match the flower.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, light, and focus. I really like the way the colors of the bee''s face match the flower.', '2008-09-10 15:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
