(4948000, 718598, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the way the lines in the bokah are reflected in the Toucan''s bill. This is a lovely shot.</td>', 'I like the way the lines in the bokah are reflected in the Toucan''s bill. This is a lovely shot.', '2008-09-10 15:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948002, 718081, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very exciting. Great colors and bold composition.</td>', 'Very exciting. Great colors and bold composition.', '2008-09-10 15:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948003, 720246, 66384, '<td valign="top">lovely smooth bokeh. pleasing cool colors. and the subject is nicely lit and isolated against the bright spot of background. Aside from all that I really like it. ;)</td>', 'lovely smooth bokeh. pleasing cool colors. and the subject is nicely lit and isolated against the bright spot of background. Aside from all that I really like it. ;)', '2008-09-10 15:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948006, 719928, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect. I like the foreground bokeh, and the composition. Also like the b&amp;w conversion.</td>', 'Very nice effect. I like the foreground bokeh, and the composition. Also like the b&w conversion.', '2008-09-10 15:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948008, 718714, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love these rich colors, and the light on the subject.</td>', 'Love these rich colors, and the light on the subject.', '2008-09-10 15:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948012, 718993, 66384, '<td valign="top">Awww, more baby toes. Love them. And I like the overexposure, which adds such softness to the image.</td>', 'Awww, more baby toes. Love them. And I like the overexposure, which adds such softness to the image.', '2008-09-10 15:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948014, 719827, 66384, '<td valign="top">There''s no doubt about the focal point of this image.</td>', 'There''s no doubt about the focal point of this image.', '2008-09-10 16:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948016, 719963, 66384, '<td valign="top">DOF not very shallow. I like your composition though.</td>', 'DOF not very shallow. I like your composition though.', '2008-09-10 16:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948025, 720295, 95361, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture...but I have to say, I don''t like that the focus is all over.  To me, there isn''t really a strong focal point.  Is it the alpha button or the part of the paper that''s in focus.</td>', 'It''s a nice picture...but I have to say, I don''t like that the focus is all over.  To me, there isn''t really a strong focal point.  Is it the alpha button or the part of the paper that''s in focus.', '2008-09-10 16:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948026, 720171, 95361, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2008-09-10 16:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948027, 720186, 95361, '<td valign="top">The background of this shot is just not out of focus enough.</td>', 'The background of this shot is just not out of focus enough.', '2008-09-10 16:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948032, 718853, 95361, '<td valign="top">The out of focus lighting really makes this picture great.  One question though, what''s the weird little bit of orange at the bottom left?</td>', 'The out of focus lighting really makes this picture great.  One question though, what''s the weird little bit of orange at the bottom left?', '2008-09-10 16:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
