(4948792, 718164, 30982, '<td valign="top">Comment only:  I would suspect this is scoring in the high 5s at a minimum but I''m lousy at estimating scores.  In my opinion, this is a very good interpretation of the challenge.  Some may want an even narrower DOF, but that''s all a matter of taste/opinion.  I particularly like the bokeh and the way it changes from lavender to green.  I like the composition as well - works for me.  If it''s not scoring as high as you''d like, it may be due to the "flower factor" - there are probably tons of flowers and plants in this challenge, and to score really high with one, it has to be very dramatic and extremely well done.  This is a very nice quiet shot - soft (in feel, not focus on your subject) and gentle.  Nothing wrong with that at all, but sometimes that won''t score as high here.  Hope this helps!</td>', 'Comment only:  I would suspect this is scoring in the high 5s at a minimum but I''m lousy at estimating scores.  In my opinion, this is a very good interpretation of the challenge.  Some may want an even narrower DOF, but that''s all a matter of taste/opinion.  I particularly like the bokeh and the way it changes from lavender to green.  I like the composition as well - works for me.  If it''s not scoring as high as you''d like, it may be due to the "flower factor" - there are probably tons of flowers and plants in this challenge, and to score really high with one, it has to be very dramatic and extremely well done.  This is a very nice quiet shot - soft (in feel, not focus on your subject) and gentle.  Nothing wrong with that at all, but sometimes that won''t score as high here.  Hope this helps!', '2008-09-10 22:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948797, 719478, 76598, '<td valign="top">The light on it seems harsh and the hard shadow of the pick distracts</td>', 'The light on it seems harsh and the hard shadow of the pick distracts', '2008-09-10 22:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
