(4948969, 718957, 98411, '<td valign="top">This photo I love! It is very powerful and has lots of meaning, I even like the lighting in it. Over all a good photo, although I would have to say the only down side of the photo was that there is too much tan in the whole thing. It is starting to blend into all the objects.</td>', 'This photo I love! It is very powerful and has lots of meaning, I even like the lighting in it. Over all a good photo, although I would have to say the only down side of the photo was that there is too much tan in the whole thing. It is starting to blend into all the objects.', '2008-09-10 23:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948971, 720162, 98411, '<td valign="top">I would say a good pic but it is too busy, and not enough lighting. Its hard to tell what it is that you are really trying to see. The title of the picture is "Leaves" but it almost looks like the theme of this picture is the wasp in the picture.</td>', 'I would say a good pic but it is too busy, and not enough lighting. Its hard to tell what it is that you are really trying to see. The title of the picture is "Leaves" but it almost looks like the theme of this picture is the wasp in the picture.', '2008-09-10 23:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948978, 720126, 98411, '<td valign="top">Its amazing that you actually caught all those hummingbirds at the feeder like that! Extra Kudos for that, but the lighting could have been better. The birds tend to blend in with the green in the backround, and they dont pop like they should. The only thing that is real noticable in this picture is the feeder. But like I said the shot is amazing of so many hummingbirds in one setting especailly the flying one.</td>', 'Its amazing that you actually caught all those hummingbirds at the feeder like that! Extra Kudos for that, but the lighting could have been better. The birds tend to blend in with the green in the backround, and they dont pop like they should. The only thing that is real noticable in this picture is the feeder. But like I said the shot is amazing of so many hummingbirds in one setting especailly the flying one.', '2008-09-10 23:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948980, 719053, 45475, '<td valign="top">Fun image. The light''s not very appealing though, but you could make it look better with some adjustments in post processing. Maybe turn down the yellows a bit too.</td>', 'Fun image. The light''s not very appealing though, but you could make it look better with some adjustments in post processing. Maybe turn down the yellows a bit too.', '2008-09-10 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948986, 719947, 98411, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatly a confussing picture... but I think the layout was great. I think if you backed up when taking this picture it would have been better. The only reason I say it was confussing was because I couldnt understand what that picture was until I looked at the title of the picture. Also the lighting could have been better the fans on the windmill dont stand out enough and in order for that windmill to pop you should have had more lighting on the fans.</td>', 'Unfortunatly a confussing picture... but I think the layout was great. I think if you backed up when taking this picture it would have been better. The only reason I say it was confussing was because I couldnt understand what that picture was until I looked at the title of the picture. Also the lighting could have been better the fans on the windmill dont stand out enough and in order for that windmill to pop you should have had more lighting on the fans.', '2008-09-10 23:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948989, 720015, 98411, '<td valign="top">WOW!!! That is a very close shot of the fly, such great lighting, great centering, great focus, great coloring. All around great picture!!!! That could be in a nature magazine, you have even managed to capture the beads of water on the leaves, which is all around amazing!</td>', 'WOW!!! That is a very close shot of the fly, such great lighting, great centering, great focus, great coloring. All around great picture!!!! That could be in a nature magazine, you have even managed to capture the beads of water on the leaves, which is all around amazing!', '2008-09-10 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948993, 719276, 98411, '<td valign="top">I HAVE NEVER SEEN A DRAGONFLY THAT CLOSE UP BEFORE!!! HOW DID YOU DO THAT!?!?!?!?!?!?! WONDERFUL PICTURE!!!! You can even see the light in the dragonflys eye, which is amazing. I had no idea that is what they really looked like up close, and now that I see them, they are not as cute as I thought they were.</td>', 'I HAVE NEVER SEEN A DRAGONFLY THAT CLOSE UP BEFORE!!! HOW DID YOU DO THAT!?!?!?!?!?!?! WONDERFUL PICTURE!!!! You can even see the light in the dragonflys eye, which is amazing. I had no idea that is what they really looked like up close, and now that I see them, they are not as cute as I thought they were.', '2008-09-10 23:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948996, 720110, 98411, '<td valign="top">CUTE PIC!!!! great lighting, and wonderful on content, so simple yet full of meaning!!! This picture would be even better in Black and white.</td>', 'CUTE PIC!!!! great lighting, and wonderful on content, so simple yet full of meaning!!! This picture would be even better in Black and white.', '2008-09-10 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948999, 720124, 98411, '<td valign="top">wow great close up and so colorful, natural, and organic!!! I even like the title!!! Good picture, great lighting, and layout. Now Im hungry for fruit salad!</td>', 'wow great close up and so colorful, natural, and organic!!! I even like the title!!! Good picture, great lighting, and layout. Now Im hungry for fruit salad!', '2008-09-10 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949002, 718991, 31776, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lot of noise in this photo and a little oversharpened.</td>', 'There seems to be a lot of noise in this photo and a little oversharpened.', '2008-09-10 23:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949007, 719474, 98411, '<td valign="top">Not enough in focus and poor lighting. I like the idea but overall it is just too cluttered, and not balanced.</td>', 'Not enough in focus and poor lighting. I like the idea but overall it is just too cluttered, and not balanced.', '2008-09-10 23:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949011, 720142, 98411, '<td valign="top">Title is too true. I like the coloring and the lighting, but it is a little too cluttered. It gets cluttered when you can see another flower in the backround only its blurry. That is my only bone to pick with this picture.</td>', 'Title is too true. I like the coloring and the lighting, but it is a little too cluttered. It gets cluttered when you can see another flower in the backround only its blurry. That is my only bone to pick with this picture.', '2008-09-10 23:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949013, 720041, 98411, '<td valign="top">WOW very powerful picture!!!</td>', 'WOW very powerful picture!!!', '2008-09-10 23:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949020, 720296, 98411, '<td valign="top">I understand what you might have been trying to do with this picture, but I think that it would have been better in color than black and white. It is too hard to take pictures of flowers in Black and white because too often are the colors in the flower peadles too soft and hard to make out what the flower actually is. Good idea but I would stick to color with flower close ups, or any plant for that matter that is not the size of a small tree up.</td>', 'I understand what you might have been trying to do with this picture, but I think that it would have been better in color than black and white. It is too hard to take pictures of flowers in Black and white because too often are the colors in the flower peadles too soft and hard to make out what the flower actually is. Good idea but I would stick to color with flower close ups, or any plant for that matter that is not the size of a small tree up.', '2008-09-10 23:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949023, 720135, 98411, '<td valign="top">HOLY GOD IS THAT AN AMAZING BUT GROSS PICTURE!!! IT GIVES ME THE CREEPIES LOOKING AT IT. HOW YOU GOT THE GUTS TO GET THAT CLOSE TO A SPIDER THAT LOOKED LIKE THAT IS BEYOND ME!!! I COULD NEVER DO IT!!!! EXTRA KUDOS FOR BRAVERY! <br/> <br/>On another note the picture is great and simple. I like the lighting an composition. Its clear and you can understand what it is.</td>', 'HOLY GOD IS THAT AN AMAZING BUT GROSS PICTURE!!! IT GIVES ME THE CREEPIES LOOKING AT IT. HOW YOU GOT THE GUTS TO GET THAT CLOSE TO A SPIDER THAT LOOKED LIKE THAT IS BEYOND ME!!! I COULD NEVER DO IT!!!! EXTRA KUDOS FOR BRAVERY!  On another note the picture is great and simple. I like the lighting an composition. Its clear and you can understand what it is.', '2008-09-10 23:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949028, 717968, 98411, '<td valign="top">SOOOO CUTE! But this picture would have been better without the backround noise. If this was a dog in a field, or with a plain backround then I think it would have been so much better. Good lighting though just work on backround noise.</td>', 'SOOOO CUTE! But this picture would have been better without the backround noise. If this was a dog in a field, or with a plain backround then I think it would have been so much better. Good lighting though just work on backround noise.', '2008-09-10 23:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949031, 718560, 98411, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA powerful and meaningful. To the point. Great lighting and great idea!</td>', 'HAHAHA powerful and meaningful. To the point. Great lighting and great idea!', '2008-09-10 23:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949034, 719478, 98411, '<td valign="top">Good idea but too busy. It takes a little while to understand that it is actually a pic on a guitars strings. I like the idea but just too busy.</td>', 'Good idea but too busy. It takes a little while to understand that it is actually a pic on a guitars strings. I like the idea but just too busy.', '2008-09-10 23:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949036, 719961, 98411, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but too grey, you need more contrast and better lighting. I like the message that this picture offers.</td>', 'Nice composition but too grey, you need more contrast and better lighting. I like the message that this picture offers.', '2008-09-10 23:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949041, 719884, 98411, '<td valign="top">Absolutley beautiful! I love everything about it, this one could be in a magazine or printed on poster board!!! Wonderful lighting, great color, great focus, and wonderful compostion!!! I give 11 but there is only a 10!</td>', 'Absolutley beautiful! I love everything about it, this one could be in a magazine or printed on poster board!!! Wonderful lighting, great color, great focus, and wonderful compostion!!! I give 11 but there is only a 10!', '2008-09-10 23:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949042, 718378, 98411, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL, BEAUTIFUL, BEAUTIFUL!!! GOD SUCH GREAT COLORING AND FOCUS!!! WONDERFUL COMPOSTION!!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL, BEAUTIFUL, BEAUTIFUL!!! GOD SUCH GREAT COLORING AND FOCUS!!! WONDERFUL COMPOSTION!!', '2008-09-10 23:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949043, 720075, 98411, '<td valign="top">WOW...JUST WOW...</td>', 'WOW...JUST WOW...', '2008-09-10 23:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
