(4949051, 719455, 98411, '<td valign="top">Fun picture but not the greatest focus. You can see that its a kernal because its surounded by unpoped kernals of popcorn. I would have backed up a little your focus is too low. But great lighting and good idea!</td>', 'Fun picture but not the greatest focus. You can see that its a kernal because its surounded by unpoped kernals of popcorn. I would have backed up a little your focus is too low. But great lighting and good idea!', '2008-09-10 23:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
