(4949055, 717874, 98411, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. Good lighting, and very low coloring which is nice in this photo. Its amazing you got so close to a hummingbird like this!</td>', 'Simple and elegant. Good lighting, and very low coloring which is nice in this photo. Its amazing you got so close to a hummingbird like this!', '2008-09-10 23:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
