(4949062, 717964, 98411, '<td valign="top">Cute and great composition. Black and white is great for this photo. Good job on composition and your lighting, although your contrast is a little to magenta, but still great photo!!</td>', 'Cute and great composition. Black and white is great for this photo. Good job on composition and your lighting, although your contrast is a little to magenta, but still great photo!!', '2008-09-10 23:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
