(4949077, 717958, 98411, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOD!!! THIS IS ABSOLUTLEY WONDERFUL AND SO POWERFUL, SOOO FULL OF MEANING, THE TITLE FITS THIS PICTURE TO A T!!!!! NOTHING TO ADD JUST WONDERFUL!!!</td>', 'OH MY GOD!!! THIS IS ABSOLUTLEY WONDERFUL AND SO POWERFUL, SOOO FULL OF MEANING, THE TITLE FITS THIS PICTURE TO A T!!!!! NOTHING TO ADD JUST WONDERFUL!!!', '2008-09-10 23:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949080, 719550, 98411, '<td valign="top">This picture is complicated and doesnt make too much sense. I think that the lighting could be better and this picture being that it is black and white could use some more contrast. I think overall this picture should have been a color picture with all the wood and different small items in it, it just seems to cluttered and confussing on what it is your actually looking at.</td>', 'This picture is complicated and doesnt make too much sense. I think that the lighting could be better and this picture being that it is black and white could use some more contrast. I think overall this picture should have been a color picture with all the wood and different small items in it, it just seems to cluttered and confussing on what it is your actually looking at.', '2008-09-10 23:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949082, 718081, 98411, '<td valign="top">Amazing sharp colors, so bold! Definatly a flower power picture!!! Great title.</td>', 'Amazing sharp colors, so bold! Definatly a flower power picture!!! Great title.', '2008-09-10 23:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949084, 719102, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and light, but a garden ornament isn''t a very exciting subject. Maybe an extreme close up of it would have made for an interesting study in textures?</td>', 'Nice colour and light, but a garden ornament isn''t a very exciting subject. Maybe an extreme close up of it would have made for an interesting study in textures?', '2008-09-10 23:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
