(4949243, 720055, 45475, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... ok, um, red is good. The light could probably be better. The source coming from the right is a bit harsh is all. Not sure I like this point of view either, why am I looking up? Feel like I''m sitting on the floor, kinda awkward. Would also be much more engaging if the model was looking directly into the lens, and, as a minor nitpick, the fan she''s holding is back-to-front. Hope this helps, good luck :)</td>', 'Hmmm... ok, um, red is good. The light could probably be better. The source coming from the right is a bit harsh is all. Not sure I like this point of view either, why am I looking up? Feel like I''m sitting on the floor, kinda awkward. Would also be much more engaging if the model was looking directly into the lens, and, as a minor nitpick, the fan she''s holding is back-to-front. Hope this helps, good luck :)', '2008-09-11 01:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949251, 717968, 45475, '<td valign="top">He/she is beautiful. The background bright spots are a bit distracting and overall the image is soft, but your basic idea is good.</td>', 'He/she is beautiful. The background bright spots are a bit distracting and overall the image is soft, but your basic idea is good.', '2008-09-11 01:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
