(4949556, 720124, 45475, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting it... looks like a blueberry being shoved into a raspberry. In any event, I think berries was a good choice, but I don''t much like the glare. Flash? Strong window light maybe? Might be better to try to diffuse light so that smooth surfaces don''t throw off that much glare.</td>', 'I''m not getting it... looks like a blueberry being shoved into a raspberry. In any event, I think berries was a good choice, but I don''t much like the glare. Flash? Strong window light maybe? Might be better to try to diffuse light so that smooth surfaces don''t throw off that much glare.', '2008-09-11 04:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
