(4949862, 720027, 77192, '<td valign="top">Love the red and blue colour ranges in this. My only tiny nitpick is I''d have liked either the sharp point further forward so it includes the front of the tomato, or the DOF extended so the front  and the stem of the tomato are on focus (but everything behind it not) I hope that makes sense :-)<br/> <br/>All in all, this is very nice though.</td>', 'Love the red and blue colour ranges in this. My only tiny nitpick is I''d have liked either the sharp point further forward so it includes the front of the tomato, or the DOF extended so the front  and the stem of the tomato are on focus (but everything behind it not) I hope that makes sense :-) All in all, this is very nice though.', '2008-09-11 08:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
