(4949928, 719859, 63499, '<td valign="top">Great job on this! The colors pop against the the white and the caterpillar looks like it is going to crawl right out of my screen.</td>', 'Great job on this! The colors pop against the the white and the caterpillar looks like it is going to crawl right out of my screen.', '2008-09-11 09:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949939, 719485, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great face, great angle and nice job on the tricky exposure a black and white animal presents.  I would move me or the dog or both over a little so there was only deck in the background and nothing would distract the eye from the dog.</td>', 'Great face, great angle and nice job on the tricky exposure a black and white animal presents.  I would move me or the dog or both over a little so there was only deck in the background and nothing would distract the eye from the dog.', '2008-09-11 09:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949940, 719901, 65234, '<td valign="top">He''s tinted pink; that''s cute.  I might have tried a different angle (presuming he stayed put for a few seconds) to get more leaves in the background so there was an interesting pattern there.</td>', 'He''s tinted pink; that''s cute.  I might have tried a different angle (presuming he stayed put for a few seconds) to get more leaves in the background so there was an interesting pattern there.', '2008-09-11 09:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949941, 719552, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, nice bokeh in that tree!  Also a great use of the challenge technique to tell a story with the background without overwhelming the subject.</td>', 'Oooh, nice bokeh in that tree!  Also a great use of the challenge technique to tell a story with the background without overwhelming the subject.', '2008-09-11 09:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949942, 719419, 65234, '<td valign="top">A shiny cocoon in a garage?  Certainly different!</td>', 'A shiny cocoon in a garage?  Certainly different!', '2008-09-11 09:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949944, 720142, 65234, '<td valign="top">Morning Glories make such interesting shapes as they fade away.  The barbed wire is a nice contrast to the flowers and vibrant greenery.</td>', 'Morning Glories make such interesting shapes as they fade away.  The barbed wire is a nice contrast to the flowers and vibrant greenery.', '2008-09-11 09:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949947, 720238, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting on the flower!  I might have cropped tighter since the background isn''t offering much in the way of patterns or colors.</td>', 'Nice backlighting on the flower!  I might have cropped tighter since the background isn''t offering much in the way of patterns or colors.', '2008-09-11 10:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949949, 720147, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I can''t find anything in really sharp focus; looks like either the bug was moving and the shutter speed was too slow or there was camera shake.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I can''t find anything in really sharp focus; looks like either the bug was moving and the shutter speed was too slow or there was camera shake.', '2008-09-11 10:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949951, 719364, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Very cool to see the arms (legs) held backwards like that.  I didn''t know they could bend that way.</td>', 'Great capture!  Very cool to see the arms (legs) held backwards like that.  I didn''t know they could bend that way.', '2008-09-11 10:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949954, 720174, 65234, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is really pretty.  Nice composition, too.  I might shift the hue of the yellow-greens to greener and desaturate slightly to better complement the purples.</td>', 'The bokeh is really pretty.  Nice composition, too.  I might shift the hue of the yellow-greens to greener and desaturate slightly to better complement the purples.', '2008-09-11 10:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949956, 717932, 65858, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract, though hard to find the shallow depth of field in here.</td>', 'Cool abstract, though hard to find the shallow depth of field in here.', '2008-09-11 10:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949958, 720160, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like finding little bits of beauty where there shouldn''t be any.  Nice find.</td>', 'I like finding little bits of beauty where there shouldn''t be any.  Nice find.', '2008-09-11 10:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949960, 720072, 65858, '<td valign="top">Pretty portrait.  The one thing is that the light seems to be brightest on her chest, leaving her face/forehead a bit dark.</td>', 'Pretty portrait.  The one thing is that the light seems to be brightest on her chest, leaving her face/forehead a bit dark.', '2008-09-11 10:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949961, 720152, 65858, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nice color.  I think the composition feels slightly awkward.</td>', 'Good idea, nice color.  I think the composition feels slightly awkward.', '2008-09-11 10:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949963, 719593, 65234, '<td valign="top">Story is well told here.  Not as emotive as a real child''s first day, but I still like the storytelling aspect.</td>', 'Story is well told here.  Not as emotive as a real child''s first day, but I still like the storytelling aspect.', '2008-09-11 10:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949964, 720176, 65858, '<td valign="top">Funny shot and a great use of DOF.  I would have liked to see a little more space around the cat.</td>', 'Funny shot and a great use of DOF.  I would have liked to see a little more space around the cat.', '2008-09-11 10:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949967, 719947, 65858, '<td valign="top">The composition is awkwardly cutting the subject in half, the color is flat, and I can see no depth of field.  Brown attempt?</td>', 'The composition is awkwardly cutting the subject in half, the color is flat, and I can see no depth of field.  Brown attempt?', '2008-09-11 10:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949968, 720246, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool shot; that bit of light in the background perfectly surrounds the spider and complements the actual light coming from below.  This wouldn''t work nearly as well if he were shot against one of the darker parts of the background.</td>', 'Cool shot; that bit of light in the background perfectly surrounds the spider and complements the actual light coming from below.  This wouldn''t work nearly as well if he were shot against one of the darker parts of the background.', '2008-09-11 10:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
