(4949972, 720055, 65234, '<td valign="top">My first thought is that too much of this is in focus for a shallow DOF challenge.  You may have shot with a fairly wide aperture but the result doesn''t look like shallow DOF to me.  Also the light is a bit harsh with that shadow on her face.  Some fill light there would help a lot.</td>', 'My first thought is that too much of this is in focus for a shallow DOF challenge.  You may have shot with a fairly wide aperture but the result doesn''t look like shallow DOF to me.  Also the light is a bit harsh with that shadow on her face.  Some fill light there would help a lot.', '2008-09-11 10:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949975, 719660, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a different sort of pose from an eagle.  Nice job on the detail; I''d like to see the eye just a touch sharper.</td>', 'Nice to see a different sort of pose from an eagle.  Nice job on the detail; I''d like to see the eye just a touch sharper.', '2008-09-11 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949980, 720083, 65234, '<td valign="top">You got some nice detail on the spider''s face.  He almost looks like he''s floating as the web is barely visible.  The background is kind of bland; I''d prefer to see some patterns or colors there.</td>', 'You got some nice detail on the spider''s face.  He almost looks like he''s floating as the web is barely visible.  The background is kind of bland; I''d prefer to see some patterns or colors there.', '2008-09-11 10:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949988, 719425, 65234, '<td valign="top">Egads; another spider!  Great detail on him and the center of the web.  I''d try a slightly different angle if possible to eliminate the bright line (wall or corner?) and/or straighten the line (it''s not quite vertical and not at enough of an angle for that to look purposeful).</td>', 'Egads; another spider!  Great detail on him and the center of the web.  I''d try a slightly different angle if possible to eliminate the bright line (wall or corner?) and/or straighten the line (it''s not quite vertical and not at enough of an angle for that to look purposeful).', '2008-09-11 10:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949990, 718853, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty kitty; I''m a sucker for the blue-eyes ones.  Bokeh is great; focus could be a little sharper on the cat''s face.</td>', 'Pretty kitty; I''m a sucker for the blue-eyes ones.  Bokeh is great; focus could be a little sharper on the cat''s face.', '2008-09-11 10:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
