(4950217, 720287, 65234, '<td valign="top">Surveying his kingdom, I see.  And from the position of his ears he was listening to you at the same time.  Majestic-looking fellow.  Background color looks a little washed out.</td>', 'Surveying his kingdom, I see.  And from the position of his ears he was listening to you at the same time.  Majestic-looking fellow.  Background color looks a little washed out.', '2008-09-11 12:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
