(4950388, 720154, 66384, '<td valign="top">Makes a nice holiday abstract.</td>', 'Makes a nice holiday abstract.', '2008-09-11 14:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950390, 719550, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve never had ramen that came from anywhere but a Styrofoam container or a cellophane wrapper. I''ll bet the real thing is much better.</td>', 'I''ve never had ramen that came from anywhere but a Styrofoam container or a cellophane wrapper. I''ll bet the real thing is much better.', '2008-09-11 14:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950392, 720020, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the narrow crop is good for this image. I''d like to see the whole spider. The faint lines of the web are nice, but they also feel cut off (unresolved) at the top.</td>', 'I don''t think the narrow crop is good for this image. I''d like to see the whole spider. The faint lines of the web are nice, but they also feel cut off (unresolved) at the top.', '2008-09-11 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950394, 720079, 66384, '<td valign="top">Yummy Autumn colors. Nice composition and I love the bokeh.</td>', 'Yummy Autumn colors. Nice composition and I love the bokeh.', '2008-09-11 14:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950397, 718175, 54634, '<td valign="top">nice concept but just if the bat is comming to hit the ball, apparently they almost show up at same level so it would have been better to keep the bat also in same focus from the top as the ball, it feels like the ball is gona pass away without touching the bat.</td>', 'nice concept but just if the bat is comming to hit the ball, apparently they almost show up at same level so it would have been better to keep the bat also in same focus from the top as the ball, it feels like the ball is gona pass away without touching the bat.', '2008-09-11 14:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950398, 720147, 66384, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus to me.</td>', 'Seems out of focus to me.', '2008-09-11 14:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950403, 719659, 83313, '<td valign="top">JPEG Police here. Please open up. I have a warrant.<br/> <br/>I noticed a slight fuzziness and a lack of detail to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 27k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one). The compression artifacts are not glaringly obvious, though, and I expect I may be the only one to leave such a comment.<br/> <br/>I also think the crop is a bit too centered. It is a nice close shot of a damsel fly, though and I expect the full size image has a lot more detail to it.</td>', 'JPEG Police here. Please open up. I have a warrant. I noticed a slight fuzziness and a lack of detail to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 27k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one). The compression artifacts are not glaringly obvious, though, and I expect I may be the only one to leave such a comment. I also think the crop is a bit too centered. It is a nice close shot of a damsel fly, though and I expect the full size image has a lot more detail to it.', '2008-09-11 14:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950406, 718989, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting view of this guy. I think he may be cropped with a little too much empty area at the top of the frame, and the bright area on his shoulder draws the eye away from his face.</td>', 'It''s an interesting view of this guy. I think he may be cropped with a little too much empty area at the top of the frame, and the bright area on his shoulder draws the eye away from his face.', '2008-09-11 14:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950407, 719789, 66384, '<td valign="top">The focal point seems off to me. It feels as if the front flower should be the primary subject for this composition. Also the border fights with the image for attention (distracting rather than complementary).</td>', 'The focal point seems off to me. It feels as if the front flower should be the primary subject for this composition. Also the border fights with the image for attention (distracting rather than complementary).', '2008-09-11 14:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950412, 719545, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bokeh and nice composition. Good shot for selling the bird feeder.</td>', 'Beautiful bokeh and nice composition. Good shot for selling the bird feeder.', '2008-09-11 14:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950413, 719040, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure exactly what the title is referring to. I think your title may be part of how it fits the topic, but it went over my head. Decent enough, though the DOF is not quite shallow enough to create a strong blur.</td>', 'Not sure exactly what the title is referring to. I think your title may be part of how it fits the topic, but it went over my head. Decent enough, though the DOF is not quite shallow enough to create a strong blur.', '2008-09-11 14:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950419, 719364, 83313, '<td valign="top">The DOF here is indeed VERY shallow, but 90% of the subject falls within that shallow plane. Well done and I expect this to be in the top 20.</td>', 'The DOF here is indeed VERY shallow, but 90% of the subject falls within that shallow plane. Well done and I expect this to be in the top 20.', '2008-09-11 14:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950420, 720066, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the colors, clarity, light, composition. The bokeh complements the subject. The yellow pedal on the left is distracting to me. If it were my image, I would blur that more, after the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the colors, clarity, light, composition. The bokeh complements the subject. The yellow pedal on the left is distracting to me. If it were my image, I would blur that more, after the challenge.', '2008-09-11 14:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950422, 719963, 83313, '<td valign="top">A lot of high ISO noise is visible in this, and the subject is interesting, but does not stand out. Perhaps some noise reduction and some additional color tweaks could give it some pop.</td>', 'A lot of high ISO noise is visible in this, and the subject is interesting, but does not stand out. Perhaps some noise reduction and some additional color tweaks could give it some pop.', '2008-09-11 14:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950423, 720039, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m glad YOU can spell his name! Nice and detailed.</td>', 'I''m glad YOU can spell his name! Nice and detailed.', '2008-09-11 14:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950425, 719352, 66384, '<td valign="top">Don''t see the shallow DOF here. Nice composition, though.</td>', 'Don''t see the shallow DOF here. Nice composition, though.', '2008-09-11 14:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950427, 719853, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like this is one of those $%!#*&amp;! things that get stuck to my pants when I walk through the tall weeds.</td>', 'Looks like this is one of those $%!#*&! things that get stuck to my pants when I walk through the tall weeds.', '2008-09-11 14:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950430, 720166, 83313, '<td valign="top">Deja-vu. Looks a lot like my February freestudy entry.</td>', 'Deja-vu. Looks a lot like my February freestudy entry.', '2008-09-11 14:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950433, 720025, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. The composition doesn''t work for me though. The center vertical line cuts the image in half, and the background in the upper half is distracting. I think I would try to get closer to the lovely blossom, and line up the shot so that the stone wall was all that was seen in the background.</td>', 'Nice DOF. The composition doesn''t work for me though. The center vertical line cuts the image in half, and the background in the upper half is distracting. I think I would try to get closer to the lovely blossom, and line up the shot so that the stone wall was all that was seen in the background.', '2008-09-11 14:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950434, 719153, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is almost, but not quite grabbing me. Not totally sure why. Maybe the lighting, maybe the colors.</td>', 'This is almost, but not quite grabbing me. Not totally sure why. Maybe the lighting, maybe the colors.', '2008-09-11 14:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950441, 719453, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. After the challenge, you might want to clone out the pollen that has fallen on the petals. I think I would like a little cropped of the right too, so that the diagonal line of the red in the background hits the upper right corner and the blue flower is on the right edge.</td>', 'Love the colors. After the challenge, you might want to clone out the pollen that has fallen on the petals. I think I would like a little cropped of the right too, so that the diagonal line of the red in the background hits the upper right corner and the blue flower is on the right edge.', '2008-09-11 14:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950444, 719622, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really want to give this entry a good vote, but I can''t. It''s a great perspective and has wonderful lighting, plus it''s got those score-raising dew droplets. Composition is great. However, the image is not taking advantage of either the 640 pixels or the 150K allowed for an entry and that takes away a lot of visual impact that it otherwise could have had. The black background also seems to not be the strong and impacting black something like this begs for.</td>', 'I really want to give this entry a good vote, but I can''t. It''s a great perspective and has wonderful lighting, plus it''s got those score-raising dew droplets. Composition is great. However, the image is not taking advantage of either the 640 pixels or the 150K allowed for an entry and that takes away a lot of visual impact that it otherwise could have had. The black background also seems to not be the strong and impacting black something like this begs for.', '2008-09-11 14:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950447, 719364, 66384, '<td valign="top">How did you do that?!!! Great shot -- such clarity. And I like the composition and light. I also like the way the bee on the flower has his legs out, warning off the other bee.</td>', 'How did you do that?!!! Great shot -- such clarity. And I like the composition and light. I also like the way the bee on the flower has his legs out, warning off the other bee.', '2008-09-11 14:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950453, 719947, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the shallow DOF here. Also the image could benefit from a levels adjustment. Also, if it were mine, I would straighten it so the windmill is vertical.</td>', 'I don''t see the shallow DOF here. Also the image could benefit from a levels adjustment. Also, if it were mine, I would straighten it so the windmill is vertical.', '2008-09-11 14:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950455, 719974, 66384, '<td valign="top">Only fault I can find with this is the blown highlight on top of his head. Beautiful clarity and nice use of shallow DOF. And I do like that bright clear eye.</td>', 'Only fault I can find with this is the blown highlight on top of his head. Beautiful clarity and nice use of shallow DOF. And I do like that bright clear eye.', '2008-09-11 14:48:24.000000', NULL, 1);
