(4950531, 719975, 86090, '<td valign="top">the focus seems to be a bit off, I can see the use of DOF, but since your background it''s dark it can be a bit hard to appreciate. Sometimes if you take your picture from slightly below it gives you a cleaner background. You almost got it, keep trying and you are going to do great ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-19 00:22:53.</i></td>', 'the focus seems to be a bit off, I can see the use of DOF, but since your background it''s dark it can be a bit hard to appreciate. Sometimes if you take your picture from slightly below it gives you a cleaner background. You almost got it, keep trying and you are going to do great ;)', '2008-09-11 15:22:22.000000', '2008-09-19 01:22:53.000000', 1),
(4950546, 720290, 86090, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be a bit off, and I can see some noise in the background, but I think it''s a great capture and the composition is really nice. also, Sometimes it''s better if your border is not too strong, talking by my own experience here.</td>', 'The focus seems to be a bit off, and I can see some noise in the background, but I think it''s a great capture and the composition is really nice. also, Sometimes it''s better if your border is not too strong, talking by my own experience here.', '2008-09-11 15:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950550, 718164, 86090, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF, it makes your subject stand out and has turned your bg in a clean soft color.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF, it makes your subject stand out and has turned your bg in a clean soft color.', '2008-09-11 15:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
