(4950561, 718564, 86090, '<td valign="top">Great capture! the duotone works really nice and helps to tell the story, I just wish you hadn''t crop his arm. 9</td>', 'Great capture! the duotone works really nice and helps to tell the story, I just wish you hadn''t crop his arm. 9', '2008-09-11 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
