(4952822, 719068, 83313, '<td valign="top">Generally, I like it, but maybe the DOF is TOO shallow, or perhaps the focused part has a touch of blur. I don''t see anything in sharp focus.</td>', 'Generally, I like it, but maybe the DOF is TOO shallow, or perhaps the focused part has a touch of blur. I don''t see anything in sharp focus.', '2008-09-12 21:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952830, 720239, 83313, '<td valign="top">The crab almost blends into the background, but then, that''s the whole point of why he is colored that way.</td>', 'The crab almost blends into the background, but then, that''s the whole point of why he is colored that way.', '2008-09-12 21:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952833, 719865, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the point that I think you are making. Frustrated with water droplet shots? I like, though it''s not quite sharp on the droplets that are the main subject, and I think they may be too centered.</td>', 'I like the point that I think you are making. Frustrated with water droplet shots? I like, though it''s not quite sharp on the droplets that are the main subject, and I think they may be too centered.', '2008-09-12 21:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
