(4952839, 719450, 63499, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and the pop of colors against the green background. However, I would have scored it higher if the whole butterfly was in focus - the out of focus wing is a little distracting to me.</td>', 'I like the DOF and the pop of colors against the green background. However, I would have scored it higher if the whole butterfly was in focus - the out of focus wing is a little distracting to me.', '2008-09-12 21:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952842, 720121, 31776, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, love the shade of blue. Like to know how you got such a bright light in the center of the flower. 7</td>', 'This is a great shot, love the shade of blue. Like to know how you got such a bright light in the center of the flower. 7', '2008-09-12 21:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952847, 719352, 31776, '<td valign="top">Nice shot although would have liked to see a more slightly out of focus background.</td>', 'Nice shot although would have liked to see a more slightly out of focus background.', '2008-09-12 21:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952848, 720244, 31776, '<td valign="top">Bet you would have liked to keep this for the numbers challenge</td>', 'Bet you would have liked to keep this for the numbers challenge', '2008-09-12 21:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952849, 720160, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of my faves of this challenge so far. I like seeing interesting shots of ordinary subjects. You caught some great light on this and it just jumped off the screen at me.  My only nitpick is that the band that is in focus seem to transition between blurry and sharp a bit abruptly. It''s hard to really judge how that will come across while in-camera. Hope this is pulling in a good score for you. A fave and a 8.</td>', 'I think this is one of my faves of this challenge so far. I like seeing interesting shots of ordinary subjects. You caught some great light on this and it just jumped off the screen at me.  My only nitpick is that the band that is in focus seem to transition between blurry and sharp a bit abruptly. It''s hard to really judge how that will come across while in-camera. Hope this is pulling in a good score for you. A fave and a 8.', '2008-09-12 21:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952850, 718184, 83313, '<td valign="top">For some odd reason I am craving onion rings with dinner.</td>', 'For some odd reason I am craving onion rings with dinner.', '2008-09-12 21:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
