(4954089, 717865, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s not grabbing me, and when I looked at your file size, I knew at least part of why:<br/> <br/>There seems to be a lack of detail to this photo that such a subject should have. I think some of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 63k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the potential detail from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'It''s not grabbing me, and when I looked at your file size, I knew at least part of why: There seems to be a lack of detail to this photo that such a subject should have. I think some of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 63k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the potential detail from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2008-09-13 22:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
