(4956709, 718806, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot, but I think I would like it better without shallow DOF... I think the other duckies in this pic are important subjects as well as the one in the center. Or perhaps if all of them were out of focus instead of just some of them.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot, but I think I would like it better without shallow DOF... I think the other duckies in this pic are important subjects as well as the one in the center. Or perhaps if all of them were out of focus instead of just some of them.', '2008-09-15 16:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
