(4956855, 718494, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very cool subject, I like what you chose to focus on! Cool square framing, too, I''m a sucker for that.</td>', 'Very cool subject, I like what you chose to focus on! Cool square framing, too, I''m a sucker for that.', '2008-09-15 18:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
