(4956881, 718223, 98141, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the rec area where I grew up in SE Michigan, the trails there are insane. Cool use of still vs. motion.</td>', 'This reminds me of the rec area where I grew up in SE Michigan, the trails there are insane. Cool use of still vs. motion.', '2008-09-15 18:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
