(4958126, 720051, 98260, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  I do however find the overall exposure to be on the dark side... excellent composition &amp; OOF elements, otherwise :)</td>', 'Great action shot.  I do however find the overall exposure to be on the dark side... excellent composition & OOF elements, otherwise :)', '2008-09-16 14:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
