(4958134, 719545, 98260, '<td valign="top">As a birder myself, I have a soft spot for hummers :)<br/> <br/>The simple fact that you''ve managed to capture 3 within the same frame is astounding !!!  I love the how the 3 hummers go from being in focus to OOF.  Nice work here.  Was this an intentional take (ie: you set up for this) or was it spur of the moment?</td>', 'As a birder myself, I have a soft spot for hummers :) The simple fact that you''ve managed to capture 3 within the same frame is astounding !!!  I love the how the 3 hummers go from being in focus to OOF.  Nice work here.  Was this an intentional take (ie: you set up for this) or was it spur of the moment?', '2008-09-16 14:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4958136, 719052, 98260, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the entire purple elements in focus vs the green background.  Plus, I feel that image is a tad dark, overall.  This image however does have great potential to be one of those killer images that end up as wall hangers :)</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the entire purple elements in focus vs the green background.  Plus, I feel that image is a tad dark, overall.  This image however does have great potential to be one of those killer images that end up as wall hangers :)', '2008-09-16 14:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
