(4958163, 718568, 98260, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot.  And original for this challenge, as well :)  My only nit with this photo is the Q in the top left corner being clipped.  I would have liked to have seen all of it.  Otherwise, this prove to be a very high scoring image for you (not to mention a very satisfying one as well) :)</td>', 'Very creative shot.  And original for this challenge, as well :)  My only nit with this photo is the Q in the top left corner being clipped.  I would have liked to have seen all of it.  Otherwise, this prove to be a very high scoring image for you (not to mention a very satisfying one as well) :)', '2008-09-16 14:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4958174, 718651, 98260, '<td valign="top">The concept for this image is FANTASTIC!!! However, the barrel distortion from your lens causes the neck bottle to appear as if it''s leaning back &amp; to the right (which I find a tad distracting.  Too bad we can''t correct that issue in Basic Editing....).  PP work is great, DOF is flawless.  Looking at this image does make me want to crack open my bottle of whiskey :)  Nice work!</td>', 'The concept for this image is FANTASTIC!!! However, the barrel distortion from your lens causes the neck bottle to appear as if it''s leaning back & to the right (which I find a tad distracting.  Too bad we can''t correct that issue in Basic Editing....).  PP work is great, DOF is flawless.  Looking at this image does make me want to crack open my bottle of whiskey :)  Nice work!', '2008-09-16 14:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
