(4958895, 720288, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think this one has unrealized potential to be a really good shot. The colors are a bit dull, and there are a ton of JPEG compression artifacts evident around all the edges of the web. Your file size of 40k bears this out. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one) I would love to see you rework this one, as I think it could be pretty good with less compression and some appropriate image adjustments.</td>', 'I think this one has unrealized potential to be a really good shot. The colors are a bit dull, and there are a ton of JPEG compression artifacts evident around all the edges of the web. Your file size of 40k bears this out. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one) I would love to see you rework this one, as I think it could be pretty good with less compression and some appropriate image adjustments.', '2008-09-17 00:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
