(4959140, 719789, 68504, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too subtle, focusing on the bud, but it is a good shallow DOF.  Might be crisper at a lower ISO, though I don''t know how much control you have with your camera. (BTW, I think your lower scores are way out of line considering that so many high scoring entries showed limited DOF, but not narrow DOF).</td>', 'Maybe a little too subtle, focusing on the bud, but it is a good shallow DOF.  Might be crisper at a lower ISO, though I don''t know how much control you have with your camera. (BTW, I think your lower scores are way out of line considering that so many high scoring entries showed limited DOF, but not narrow DOF).', '2008-09-17 02:02:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959149, 720000, 19708, '<td valign="top"><i>(pressing my automated playback response button)</i> <br/>Congrats on yet <u>another</u> Blue Irene!<br/> <br/>Now, come join us in capturing the real world around us. There''s all sorts of cool stuff out there like <strike> water,</strike> landscapes, people, <strike>colors,</strike> natural <strike>abstracts</strike> stuff, <strike>flowers,</strike> <strike>feathers,</strike> oh heck you are hereby limited to photographing cardboard boxes in a pitch dark room.<br/>;)</td>', '(pressing my automated playback response button) Congrats on yet another Blue Irene! Now, come join us in capturing the real world around us. There''s all sorts of cool stuff out there like  water, landscapes, people, colors, natural abstracts stuff, flowers, feathers, oh heck you are hereby limited to photographing cardboard boxes in a pitch dark room.;)', '2008-09-17 02:08:30.000000', NULL, 0),
