(4959169, 719923, 97166, '<td valign="top">A photo I can get involved with on a far deeper level than anything on the front page. Missed it during voting, unfortunately.<br/> <br/>Also, as unfortunate, is the fact that while it shows shallow DOF on a relative scale, it doesn''t hit you over the head with it.  Although I think you knew that.</td>', 'A photo I can get involved with on a far deeper level than anything on the front page. Missed it during voting, unfortunately. Also, as unfortunate, is the fact that while it shows shallow DOF on a relative scale, it doesn''t hit you over the head with it.  Although I think you knew that.', '2008-09-17 02:19:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959170, 720000, 32872, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS!!!  Boy do you have the talent or what? This is amazing.</td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS!!!  Boy do you have the talent or what? This is amazing.', '2008-09-17 02:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959172, 719501, 33352, '<td valign="top">Great work Roz,I like this more than earlier finishers, very good color.</td>', 'Great work Roz,I like this more than earlier finishers, very good color.', '2008-09-17 02:21:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959176, 720079, 33352, '<td valign="top">Awe come on this is a painting (joke) very well taken and processed.</td>', 'Awe come on this is a painting (joke) very well taken and processed.', '2008-09-17 02:23:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959178, 720000, 97166, '<td valign="top">*EDIT*  Nevermind, that''s just unfair of me, and undeserved.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the blue.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-17 01:40:33.</i></td>', '*EDIT*  Nevermind, that''s just unfair of me, and undeserved. Congrats on the blue.', '2008-09-17 02:24:37.000000', '2008-09-17 02:40:33.000000', 0),
(4959183, 720209, 33352, '<td valign="top">Love the old style coloring,well done Deb.</td>', 'Love the old style coloring,well done Deb.', '2008-09-17 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959187, 718269, 33352, '<td valign="top">Now what is a 5 O''clock shadow doing on a Slipper Orchid, was he kissing you toes? really like the depth of color in the orchid.</td>', 'Now what is a 5 O''clock shadow doing on a Slipper Orchid, was he kissing you toes? really like the depth of color in the orchid.', '2008-09-17 02:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959188, 718494, 97166, '<td valign="top">This was my pick for top-spot, and while a top 10 is nothing to sniff at, it boggles my mind that some of the things that beat this... well... beat it.<br/> <br/>It''s not only the technical aspects either, but this mantis exudes a personality that shouldn''t be attributable to an insect.  The pose, the lighting, the isolation, it all comes together in an amazing, amazing way. Incredibly amazing. Too amazing for these dingbats that vote on such things ;)</td>', 'This was my pick for top-spot, and while a top 10 is nothing to sniff at, it boggles my mind that some of the things that beat this... well... beat it. It''s not only the technical aspects either, but this mantis exudes a personality that shouldn''t be attributable to an insect.  The pose, the lighting, the isolation, it all comes together in an amazing, amazing way. Incredibly amazing. Too amazing for these dingbats that vote on such things ;)', '2008-09-17 02:29:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959191, 719458, 97166, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the super-human feat of placing 4th with a subject that is slightly out-of-focus/suffering from camera shake.  That''s incredible!</td>', 'Congrats on the super-human feat of placing 4th with a subject that is slightly out-of-focus/suffering from camera shake.  That''s incredible!', '2008-09-17 02:33:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959193, 720132, 97166, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t hang on to your 7, but if DrAchoo''s mantis couldn''t, this didn''t stand a chance :)  You beat him though! Good job.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t hang on to your 7, but if DrAchoo''s mantis couldn''t, this didn''t stand a chance :)  You beat him though! Good job.', '2008-09-17 02:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959194, 720026, 62357, '<td valign="top">well done again Andi!  You are on a bit of a roll I think.</td>', 'well done again Andi!  You are on a bit of a roll I think.', '2008-09-17 02:36:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959197, 719646, 33352, '<td valign="top">What an amazing women there is under your facade of strength, as well as the photo being awesome creating a shallow dof on white, the words are a 10 from me for giving them a true meaning of the photo.</td>', 'What an amazing women there is under your facade of strength, as well as the photo being awesome creating a shallow dof on white, the words are a 10 from me for giving them a true meaning of the photo.', '2008-09-17 02:39:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959201, 719625, 87158, '<td valign="top">Good shot w/ DOF.  Razor sharp focus for on the richly-glowing orange fin.  As I look into the shot the blue on the blurred fin grabs a little too much attention.  Almost does not feel like mid-day daylight!</td>', 'Good shot w/ DOF.  Razor sharp focus for on the richly-glowing orange fin.  As I look into the shot the blue on the blurred fin grabs a little too much attention.  Almost does not feel like mid-day daylight!', '2008-09-17 02:43:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959205, 719161, 97225, '<td valign="top">I liked this best of all in this challenge. It is so clean and elegant. I gave you 10.</td>', 'I liked this best of all in this challenge. It is so clean and elegant. I gave you 10.', '2008-09-17 02:47:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959206, 720000, 31533, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, you clearly know what works for the DPC crowd.</td>', 'Congratulations, you clearly know what works for the DPC crowd.', '2008-09-17 02:49:09.000000', NULL, 0),
