(4959434, 718494, 66597, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Doc! You got me by two places :-) And I do love a good preying mantis photo, especially with such shallow DOF!</td>', 'Congrats, Doc! You got me by two places :-) And I do love a good preying mantis photo, especially with such shallow DOF!', '2008-09-17 08:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959459, 718269, 66597, '<td valign="top">Another lovely orchid photo from you, Julianne! Sorry you missed that 6 so narrowly, but who cares, right? This is a pretty hard one to find much fault with, LOL. Some of the OOF stems are a bit distracting, but one could also say they had depth, so really a matter of taste. Love the colors and great title, too!</td>', 'Another lovely orchid photo from you, Julianne! Sorry you missed that 6 so narrowly, but who cares, right? This is a pretty hard one to find much fault with, LOL. Some of the OOF stems are a bit distracting, but one could also say they had depth, so really a matter of taste. Love the colors and great title, too!', '2008-09-17 09:08:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959462, 720258, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very cool entry, Jeffrey. I''ve seen a lot of great photos that IMO should have scored higher - this is one of them. That Sigma is a lot of fun, isn''t it?</td>', 'Very cool entry, Jeffrey. I''ve seen a lot of great photos that IMO should have scored higher - this is one of them. That Sigma is a lot of fun, isn''t it?', '2008-09-17 09:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959463, 720132, 32767, '<td valign="top">WTG!</td>', 'WTG!', '2008-09-17 09:15:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959465, 717854, 66597, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, nice one, Peter! Really captures the theme well, and such a beautiful line along the edge of that leaf!</td>', 'Ooooh, nice one, Peter! Really captures the theme well, and such a beautiful line along the edge of that leaf!', '2008-09-17 09:16:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959467, 718231, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful - can''t believe it didn''t finish higher. A few people may have found the red flower a bit offsetting. Her eyes are mesmerizing, and this capture the shallow DOF theme so well!</td>', 'This is really beautiful - can''t believe it didn''t finish higher. A few people may have found the red flower a bit offsetting. Her eyes are mesmerizing, and this capture the shallow DOF theme so well!', '2008-09-17 09:18:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959472, 719364, 82112, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the ribbon and wonderful comments, although I''d sure like to know what possessed someone to vote 1 or 2. What could I have done differently for you to have at least bumped me up to a friendly 3? ;-P<br/> <br/>As I recall, it was quite windy that day and everything was moving around quite a bit, including the flower which was on the end of a long stalk. Lucky to snap this one.<br/> <br/>Had a difficult time deciding between this and many others, including: <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=722425" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82112/120/722425.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82112/120/722425.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82112/120/722425.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=722426" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82112/120/722426.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82112/120/722426.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82112/120/722426.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=722428" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82112/120/722428.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82112/120/722428.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82112/120/722428.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Thanks for looking.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-17 08:38:39.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all for the ribbon and wonderful comments, although I''d sure like to know what possessed someone to vote 1 or 2. What could I have done differently for you to have at least bumped me up to a friendly 3? ;-P As I recall, it was quite windy that day and everything was moving around quite a bit, including the flower which was on the end of a long stalk. Lucky to snap this one. Had a difficult time deciding between this and many others, including:     Thanks for looking.', '2008-09-17 09:26:25.000000', '2008-09-17 09:38:39.000000', 0),
