(4959513, 720209, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find your notes interesting, as I was not sure about it when voting, and the blurred part being in the foreground, partially blocking the rest was kind of odd. I waffled between 5-7 and then decided that something that made me look that carefully deserved the 7. Didn''t leave a comment, as I was speed-voting at the last minute and could not nail down what I liked/disliked about it at the time. I think what I really like is the the curled leaves, and the way the light is playing on it. The tilted background adds some interest. The blurred foreground leaves blocking the main subject is the only real issue with this one, but the rest of the image is strong and carries it through.  I''m really impressed by a lot of your recent B&amp;W work.</td>', 'I find your notes interesting, as I was not sure about it when voting, and the blurred part being in the foreground, partially blocking the rest was kind of odd. I waffled between 5-7 and then decided that something that made me look that carefully deserved the 7. Didn''t leave a comment, as I was speed-voting at the last minute and could not nail down what I liked/disliked about it at the time. I think what I really like is the the curled leaves, and the way the light is playing on it. The tilted background adds some interest. The blurred foreground leaves blocking the main subject is the only real issue with this one, but the rest of the image is strong and carries it through.  I''m really impressed by a lot of your recent B&W work.', '2008-09-17 09:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
