(4959660, 718231, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Darn!  I was hoping to see this one on the front page  :(    I think the composition is awesome.   She looks like she is poking her head right off the screen.    Congratulations on achieving your 2nd highest score with this photo.   It is beautiful.   Sophia should be very proud.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Darn!  I was hoping to see this one on the front page  :(    I think the composition is awesome.   She looks like she is poking her head right off the screen.    Congratulations on achieving your 2nd highest score with this photo.   It is beautiful.   Sophia should be very proud. ', '2008-09-17 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 0),
