(4959730, 720000, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Irene, I reeeeeeeeeeallly love this one.   I''m so in awe at the perfection with which you set these shots up.  I was trying to do a set-up shot last night and ended up feeling like the worst snapshot photographer on the planet and gave up :(   Sigh.    You never miss.   Bravo for such mastery.<br/> <br/>Mega Congratulations. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks, Sandy. I know the final result seems so smooth and easy but I promise you I can''t count the times I''ve also felt like the worlds worst snapshooter.<br/>Even with this one, it took me three evenings to get it right, my neck and schoulders were aching with bending over to hold the sheet above the spoons in the darn light-tent at a thousand different angles and the camera was killing my hand and arm holding it up. I swore so many times, I''m sure I''ll never get anywhere near heaven... (must have a word with Enzo about that ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Irene, I reeeeeeeeeeallly love this one.   I''m so in awe at the perfection with which you set these shots up.  I was trying to do a set-up shot last night and ended up feeling like the worst snapshot photographer on the planet and gave up :(   Sigh.    You never miss.   Bravo for such mastery. Mega Congratulations.  Thanks, Sandy. I know the final result seems so smooth and easy but I promise you I can''t count the times I''ve also felt like the worlds worst snapshooter.Even with this one, it took me three evenings to get it right, my neck and schoulders were aching with bending over to hold the sheet above the spoons in the darn light-tent at a thousand different angles and the camera was killing my hand and arm holding it up. I swore so many times, I''m sure I''ll never get anywhere near heaven... (must have a word with Enzo about that ;-)', '2008-09-17 11:50:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959757, 718378, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the bold complementary colors and the composition. The detail in the flower is awesome, and the bokeh is lovely.</td>', 'Love the bold complementary colors and the composition. The detail in the flower is awesome, and the bokeh is lovely.', '2008-09-17 12:07:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4959762, 720204, 66384, '<td valign="top">Having grown up in the South, I have had my share of Okra. I haven''t liked any of it! This is the first Okra I have appreciated. ;) It really is a lovely image.<br/> <br/>eta: I''d paint the lower right corner green, now that the basic challenge is over.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-17 11:12:04.</i></td>', 'Having grown up in the South, I have had my share of Okra. I haven''t liked any of it! This is the first Okra I have appreciated. ;) It really is a lovely image. eta: I''d paint the lower right corner green, now that the basic challenge is over.', '2008-09-17 12:09:26.000000', '2008-09-17 12:12:04.000000', 0),
