(4959791, 720200, 61961, '<td valign="top">I only voted on about 70% of the entries in this challenge and this was one I didn''t get to!  However, I love the colors, and it is refreshing to see a subject other than a flower or insect, despite the high quality of many of those images.</td>', 'I only voted on about 70% of the entries in this challenge and this was one I didn''t get to!  However, I love the colors, and it is refreshing to see a subject other than a flower or insect, despite the high quality of many of those images.', '2008-09-17 12:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
