(4959837, 720204, 63218, '<td valign="top">For the first time, as I''m looking thru the challenge results I''m able to recognize names &amp; personalities I''ve become familiar with in side challenges &amp; forums.  I see &amp; recognize beautiful photography like this &amp; feel surprised at how the voting turned out. For the first time it occurs to me in a meaningful way that if others are working to their own standards &amp; artistic vision, so can I.  I didn''t enter this challenge because I couldn''t escape the dead weight of knowing I can''t pander to the voters.  This beautiful shot is an inspiration. Shooting outdoors under a cloudy sky is something I often do. I love the soft shadows of low ambient light.  The mystery.  If I''d voted in this challenge, I hope I would''ve had the eyes to see it so I could give it a 10.</td>', 'For the first time, as I''m looking thru the challenge results I''m able to recognize names & personalities I''ve become familiar with in side challenges & forums.  I see & recognize beautiful photography like this & feel surprised at how the voting turned out. For the first time it occurs to me in a meaningful way that if others are working to their own standards & artistic vision, so can I.  I didn''t enter this challenge because I couldn''t escape the dead weight of knowing I can''t pander to the voters.  This beautiful shot is an inspiration. Shooting outdoors under a cloudy sky is something I often do. I love the soft shadows of low ambient light.  The mystery.  If I''d voted in this challenge, I hope I would''ve had the eyes to see it so I could give it a 10.', '2008-09-17 12:56:05.000000', NULL, 0),
