(4960675, 720000, 61315, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/> <br/>Even with this one, it took me three evenings to get it right, my neck and schoulders were aching with bending over to hold the sheet above the spoons in the darn light-tent at a thousand different angles and the camera was killing my hand and arm holding it up. I swore so many times, I''m sure I''ll never get anywhere near heaven... (must have a word with Enzo about that ;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><b>Congratulations on another Blue!</b> Your work is so wonderful and I really appreciate your sharing the setup and details of the shot - you have the patience of a saint, even if you have the vocabulary of a sailor! I probably would have given up after the first 50 shots! :-D.</td>', 'Originally posted by IreneM:  Even with this one, it took me three evenings to get it right, my neck and schoulders were aching with bending over to hold the sheet above the spoons in the darn light-tent at a thousand different angles and the camera was killing my hand and arm holding it up. I swore so many times, I''m sure I''ll never get anywhere near heaven... (must have a word with Enzo about that ;-)   Congratulations on another Blue! Your work is so wonderful and I really appreciate your sharing the setup and details of the shot - you have the patience of a saint, even if you have the vocabulary of a sailor! I probably would have given up after the first 50 shots! :-D.', '2008-09-17 20:01:12.000000', NULL, 0),
