(4961629, 719865, 97950, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments guys. <br/>Knew it wasn''t good enough before submission, but I fell in love with this one over all the 400 other shots I took.<br/>The stubborn streak in me decided to enter it still, even knowing the imperfections.<br/>In deleting the others today, I am no longer blinded and see shots which would have better appreciated.<br/>Way too funny !LOL!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments guys. Knew it wasn''t good enough before submission, but I fell in love with this one over all the 400 other shots I took.The stubborn streak in me decided to enter it still, even knowing the imperfections.In deleting the others today, I am no longer blinded and see shots which would have better appreciated.Way too funny !LOL!', '2008-09-18 12:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
