(4967445, 720170, 67697, '<td valign="top">BUT you did get a shallow DOF lol.  I think it''s a cute and quirky photo.  It''s fun to put in photos to challenge the viewers lol</td>', 'BUT you did get a shallow DOF lol.  I think it''s a cute and quirky photo.  It''s fun to put in photos to challenge the viewers lol', '2008-09-22 01:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4967463, 720209, 67697, '<td valign="top">Shallow indeed.  The colortone is perfect and that curl is definitely a great find.  I see it as inviting the viewers into the picture to come and see more.  Pretty cool.</td>', 'Shallow indeed.  The colortone is perfect and that curl is definitely a great find.  I see it as inviting the viewers into the picture to come and see more.  Pretty cool.', '2008-09-22 01:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
